// NOT THE DEPLOYED RULESET — do not edit or deploy from here.
//
// Asset Management uses the shared Firebase project `pr-system-4ea55`.
// The canonical Firestore rules for that project are owned and deployed
// from the Nexus Portal repository:
//
//   ../1PWR Nexus/nexus-portal/firestore.rules
//
// The canonical rules already enforce the signed Nexus effectivePrivilege
// claim for all am_core_* collections (view/operate/approve/administer
// ladder). This file previously held a permissionLevel-based ruleset that
// predates the Nexus migration; it is retained below as a comment only so
// it can never be accidentally deployed over the canonical rules.
//
// Historical note: the old rules gated writes on users/{uid}.permissionLevel
// and capabilities flags; both were superseded by the signed claim ladder on
// 2026-08-11. Git history retains the full previous content.
